      "answer": "$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\sin2x+2\\sqrt{x}\\cos2x$; at $x=a$, $\\sin2a+4a\\cos2a=0$, hence $\\tan2a=-4a$.",
